e":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-10T07:27:56-07:00","id":1102260,"title":"","content":"Like what other powers tell me and i might think about it but for now i will try to make regen there only power for now<br /> maybe the ageless thing might be in another group a clut maybe then maybe we make project immortal like lostlights project x-o wher he made villainous groups<br /> i have another group with revival powers maybe a bloodline with revivfy dread power but with out spending a permanent dot stamina or the willpower cost but still have to roll dice as per the dread power<br /> then we can work on the gangster with plages and the guys with with extra skill dice btw they might pay a willpower point to gain extra dice on a roll instead of a scene and maybe make it any roll not just skill rolls","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13426-ameraaaaaa","name":"Ameraaaaaa","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"320"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-10T09:36:30-07:00","id":1102282,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ameraaaaaa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1092769-conspiracy-ideas?p=1102260#post1102260\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Like what other powers tell me and i might think about it but for now i will try to make regen there only power for now</div> </div> </div> </div>&lt;shrug&gt; Depends on where the agelessness comes from. If it is via dead-like state, then they might get to downgrade damage like 2E vampires do (even with damage downgrading, without natural healing, the bashing damage would add up and kill them). If from some demonic pact, their patron might offer other abilities. If through some retro-viral infection, look at the Infected in Hurt Locker for ideas. If via more Mage-like temporal stasis, maybe they have minor Time powers.<br /> <br /> Some other abilities might have been triggered by countering the &quot;can't heal&quot; side-effect with hyper-regenerative werewolf blood - spirit powers or minor transformation, and the like. Just using the werewolf blood on someone who hasn't undergone the ageless process triggers bad reactions (like cancer that kills you in days or hours), so said advantages are still limited to this Hunter group.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ameraaaaaa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1092769-conspiracy-ideas?p=1102260#post1102260\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">maybe the ageless thing might be in another group a clut maybe then maybe we make project immortal like lostlights project x-o wher he made villainous groups</div> </div> </div> </div>Sure. I'm just trying to help with ideas.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ameraaaaaa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1092769-conspiracy-ideas?p=1102260#post1102260\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">i have another group with revival powers maybe a bloodline with revivfy dread power but with out spending a permanent dot stamina or the willpower cost but still have to roll dice as per the dread power</div> </div> </div> </div>Revival is pretty strong. The Stamina Dot is basically a 4XP tax on use (and a reliable way to get around it). Maybe tie it to a Condition? Upon resurrection, they have the Condition, and if they die with it, they can't revive. The Condition could fade with time, or upon some criteria (killing one of their bloodline, stealing another soul, paying Resurrection Inc their fee, etc.).<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ameraaaaaa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1092769-conspiracy-ideas?p=1102260#post1102260\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">then we can work on the gangster with plages and the guys with with extra skill dice btw they might pay a willpower point to gain extra dice on a roll instead of a scene and maybe make it any roll not just skill rolls</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay? I'm more of an ideas person as far as Changeling goes. Someone else is probably better versed in the exact mechanics. Work out a few Pledges they can use (and are limited to), and they should be fine. If tying into the whole Goblin Debt thing, have them acquire a point of Debt instead of paying the Glamour to seal/make the Pledge.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 06-10-2017, 12:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-11T00:13:44-07:00","id":1102451,"title":"","content":"i forgot to post it but my mind has changed anyway so here we go<br /> so lets give up on the ageless power at cost of not healing instead it should be the status 5th dot and should be a rare formula that take a lot of mining in a special place and without the no healing flaw i think the flaw was to big anyway instead i have another idea but i will save that for later after more thinking<br /> for revival what about a week though i personally prefer it as it is but we will discuss it<br /> i think the endowment for the gangsters should at as a limit to how many pledges they can have at once i don't think more limits are needed and instead of glamour they use willpower if we need more limits then maybe it lowers the permanent willpower as long as you have a pledge going on and it stacks","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13426,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13426-ameraaaaaa","user":"Ameraaaaaa","date":". 06-11-2017, 06:59 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13426-ameraaaaaa","name":"Ameraaaaaa","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value"