ainer\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ameraaaaaa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1092769-conspiracy-ideas?p=1102451#post1102451\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">for revival what about a week though i personally prefer it as it is but we will discuss it</div> </div> </div> </div>So, they are vulnerable for a week after resurrecting?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ameraaaaaa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1092769-conspiracy-ideas?p=1102451#post1102451\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">i think the endowment for the gangsters should at as a limit to how many pledges they can have at once i don't think more limits are needed and instead of glamour they use willpower if we need more limits then maybe it lowers the permanent willpower as long as you have a pledge going on and it stacks</div> </div> </div> </div>What about capping it at Willpower? Minimum of 2, maximum of 10, average limit is 4. Or have each Pledge (beyond the first?) lower their Integrity by 1 - they are literally tying it together with parts of their souls (kinda).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-11T20:03:13-07:00","id":1102688,"title":"","content":"Just the ageless part and for another conspiracy<br /> Just a week if at all btw maybe make them able to come to life even if there killed by avg damage<br /> agein why do we need these limit the only one that sounds interesting is integrity because it makes sense for gangster but tell me why we need so much limits","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13426-ameraaaaaa","name":"Ameraaaaaa","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"320"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-12T04:23:21-07:00","id":1102759,"title":"","content":"Because these are Hunters - they are barely above the capabilities of normal mortals (who most <i>are</i>). They don't get powers full supernaturals would envy. Such abilities <i>cost</i>. And the costs/limits are some of the best part, anyways - they make you think.<br /> <br /> Look at how 2E Endowments are being constructed (at least in this draft). Everything needs to balance out. It should be a similar principle here. Or even more limited, since these seem closer to Compacts in scope, and thus don't have the degree of resources that the older/bigger Conspiracies do.<br /> <br /> Why <i>should</i> some starting group discover no-downside regeneration (better than Werewolf?), unbeatable resurrection (better than Mummies), or stealing another splat's abilities? If it is so easy, why didn't others do it?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-12T05:27:28-07:00","id":1102774,"title":"","content":"4 things <br /> 1 i hate 2ed endowment a lot of endowment have no weekness like weapon of last resort or ageis telasmen<br /> 2 regen equals dots 1 dot just heal 2 bashing and 1 lethal even 5 dots makes it only 10 bashing and 5 lethal with 3ed status if all 5 dots then heal all bashing 5 status then all lethal but highly skilled gunman with big rifle can kill in 1 shot much less a mage and it dosnt help with avgreated damage and i might give them weekness to silver like werewolf maybe but for the above facts might say they got rid of it<br /> 3 not unbeatable resurrection they need to do a die roll stamina and survival plus dread power they fail plus it dos not give them any other feature so why not make it strong plus i might add week of vulnerability afterwards like thanks foe vulnerability condition idea btw but still might not even that<br /> whats wrong with having another spat ability theres canin endowment that give you dread powers supel can keep revivfy and another 5 dot in any other just need to eat monster and that Japanese one can steel dread powers","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13426-ameraaaaaa","name":"Ameraaaaaa","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"320"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-12T18:38:10-07:00","id":1102975,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ameraaaaaa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1092769-conspiracy-ideas?p=1102774#post1102774\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">4 things<br /> 1 i hate 2ed endowment a lot of endowment have no weekness like weapon of last resort or ageis telasmen</div> </div> </div> </div>I never said weaknesses - I said costs or limits. These <i>can</i> be weaknesses, or they can be their own less powerful nature. The Last Resort is a weapon, same as any other - hardly special. The Aegis Talisman requires 5 dots in the Endowment, only provides armor, and cost Willpower to use.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ameraaaaaa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1092769-conspiracy-ideas?p=1102774#post1102774\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">2 regen equals dots 1 dot just heal 2 bashing and 1 lethal even 5 dots makes it only 10 bashing and 5 lethal with 3ed status if all 5 dots then heal all bashing 5 status then all lethal but highly skilled gunman with big rifle can kill in 1 shot much less a mage and it dosnt help with avgreated damage and i might give them weekness to silver like werewolf maybe but for the above facts might say they got rid of it</div> </div> </div> </div>Is this Regen per Day, Scene, or Turn? If Turn, this is better than Werewolf regeneration and the Ringsel (AKD Relic) in comparison. It doesn't matter if a sinper can down them - this is still far more powerful than similar abilities. And if they get their Regen from Werewolves, why would they <i>not</i> be vulnerable to silver? This just sounds like a blatant HFY.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ameraaaaaa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1092769-conspiracy-ideas?p=1102774#post1102774\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">3 not unbeatable resurrection they need to do a die roll stamina and survival plus dread power they fail plus it dos not give them any other feature so why not make it strong plus i might add week of vulnerability afterwards like thanks foe vulnerability condition idea btw but still might not even that<br /> whats wrong with having another spat ability theres canin endowment that give you dread powers supel can keep revivfy and another 5 dot in any other just need to eat monster and that Japanese one can steel dread powers</div> </div> </div> </div>Stamina + Survival + Power dots? Looking at dice pools of 7+, easy. Like that is going to have any real risk of failure. Which makes it far better than Revivify, or similar abilities other monsters have. Anthropophagy requires you to capture and eat said supernaturals (hardly easy), and Setto needs to have the Hunter con the target, has limitations on how many powers can be acquired, and requires an Attribute + Skill - Dots roll.<br /> <br /> And that's only 3.<br /> <br /> I mean, you can do what you want at your table, of course. I just think these would be more widely accepted if they had fitting and interesting limits.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-12T19:39:54-07:00","id":1102993,"title":"","content":"4 things<br /> 1 the weapon of last resort dos not get downgraded to bashing and ageis telasmen dos not need willpower for the armer just for the fear effect<br /> 2 well It's ment to be like a werewolf in war ftom so thats why plus at low levels it bearly dos anything and if more then one person attacks you in 1 trun then your screwed plue mosters can some times avg damage then your still screwed and if mind controled well you get the idea its not ment to make you unkillable its ment to give some searvablety to characters that might need it stroy wise maybe with bio engineering they get rid of the silver weekness and most likely im giving silver weekness<br /> 3 thats how revivfy works no change other then getting rid os stamina cost so people dont just pick supel instead plus like the dread power if you read it it says if killed by avg damage then your screwed plus we are adding the week of vulnerability plus dice are random so yeah<br /> 4 most of my ideas i shoot 